{"entryId":"1685","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1685:1","sourceSha256":"5ec1e25a390d701cf14f639713a38e40b84c9c420b7aeb6f3713f385c49611fe","englishSha256":"e0c64ed4ddc86fd0968a76625de6cccb3f1d278d8ba519c1829efdd27b6da59f","citations":[{"id":"1685:1:citation-01","he":[16,66],"en":[93,105],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_113a.10"},"reference":"Shabbat 113a:10","assessment":"The checked Shabbat gives R. Yehudah bar Levi and asks about moving loom implements. Preserve the received heading and explicitly mark the compiler’s emendation.","evidence":[{"reference":"Shabbat 113a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_113a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1685:1:citation-02","he":[67,110],"en":[107,117],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_60a.16"},"reference":"Niddah 60a:16","assessment":"Niddah has the same questioner and respondent, on a different matter: attributing a stain to a preexisting stain.","evidence":[{"reference":"Niddah 60a:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_60a.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"The title MiLevi remains the received heading. Both checked Bavli passages read bar Levi.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Shabbat 113a:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_113a.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 60a:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_60a.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
